{"id":"n14287-2-5","stage":2,"title":"야단 · 责骂","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14287-2-5-1","ko":"너 그러다가 아버지께 야단을 맞을걸?","zh":"你这样下去怕是要被爸爸骂的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"그러다가","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러다가","audio":"/audio/3e56eeec55ce469ad0b3.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지께","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지께","audio":"/audio/57ef340895b9f00d21d9.mp3"}},{"text":"야단을","meaning":"责骂，训斥","explanation":"야단：责骂，训斥；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야단","audio":"/audio/fbe5e56591096faea085.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14287","senseId":"2","lemma":"야단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야단을","audio":"/audio/546797975cb8e5d42791.mp3"}},{"text":"맞을걸?","meaning":"遭遇","explanation":"맞다：遭遇；을걸：表示推测，或对没有做某事表示遗憾；由完整句子判断。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66232","senseId":"6","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞을걸","audio":"/audio/71cb8c63c41867b0adae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"fbe5e56591096fae","term":"야단","zh":"责骂，训斥","audio":"/audio/fbe5e56591096faea085.mp3","entryId":"14287","definition":"大声教训他人的错误。","pronunciation":["야ː단"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"遭遇","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66232","definition":"遇上不好的事。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b066a905625f0d3ba8fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14287-2-5-2","ko":"그럼 그냥 솔직하게 말씀드릴까?","zh":"那我就老老实实跟他说吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"솔직하게","meaning":"坦诚，坦率","explanation":"솔직하다：坦诚，坦率；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"솔직하다","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85310","senseId":"1","lemma":"솔직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"솔직하게","audio":"/audio/e76c709985f324d1b740.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀드릴까?","meaning":"话；给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"말씀：话；드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"2","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀드릴까","audio":"/audio/1670406158823e3ba569.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"c86a5bfccc9f530c","term":"솔직하다","zh":"坦诚，坦率","audio":"/audio/c86a5bfccc9f530c41cb.mp3","entryId":"85310","definition":"不虚伪，不做作。","pronunciation":["솔찌카다"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(谦词)自己的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bed0e37d59e4f321704.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.37,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14287","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.1967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你这样下去怕是要被爸爸骂的吧？","那我就老老实实跟他说吧？","从初夏开始雨季就开始了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你这样下去怕是要被爸爸骂的吧？","那我就老老实实跟他说吧？","从初夏开始雨季就开始了。"],"answer":1}]}
